WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.220
Dad wants us to pick
up where he left off --

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.430
Saving people, hunting things.

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:06.800
The family business.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:12.750
I have these nightmares,
and sometimes they come true.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.380
Come again?

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.890
I dreamt about jessica's
death before it happened.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.540
A vision. Started out as nightmares.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.350
Then he started having
them while he was awake.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.670
The closer I get to anything involving
the demon, the stronger the visions get.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.320
The demon said he had plans
for me and the children like me.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.060
Do you have any idea
what he meant by that?

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.370
No,I don'T.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:34.400
Max,your abilities -They started
six,seven months ago,right?

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.200
How'd you know that?

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.200
'Cause that's when my abilities started.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.540
The same thing killed our mothers.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.480
You and I are chosen.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.510
For what? I don't know.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:46.110
The thing I don't get is why.
I guess because we're so alike?

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:48.470
Max is nothing like you.
Sam,max is a monster.

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:50.420
He's already killed two people.
Now he's gunning for a third.

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:56.440
Did he say anything to you?

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:58.190
No.

00:00:58.610 --> 00:01:00.890
Nothing.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:25.570
Hello? Yeah.

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:29.380
All right.

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:58.010
Afternoon,dennis. Hey,doc.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.240
I'd like to look at a gun.

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:03.200
Yeah,right,doc.

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:06.670
Seriously?

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.520
That one.

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:21.790
Okay.

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:27.670
That's a turkey hunter.
12-Gauge. Pump-Action.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.610
Don't leave enough turkey
behind,if you ask me.

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:35.690
What,uh,what sort of shells does it use?

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:38.740
Right here.

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:42.260
I'm taking the boys up to the
cabin this weekend,if you're,uh...

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:46.300
I mean,if you think you might
like to take up the sport.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.390
Thanks,but no.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:50.930
You know guns make me
nervous. Always have.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.820
This one goes in here, right?

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:57.050
Whoa. Doc! No,no,you can't load a
weapon on the premises. It's illegal!

00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:58.640
It's okay,dennis. No,no.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:03.280
It's okay,dennis. It's all gonna be

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:05.040
Okay.

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.440
Doc!

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.070
What's going on?

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:12.540
No,no,it's okay. It's okay.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.930
It's all gonna be... okay.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:36.730
Sam,come on,zip it up. Let's hit the...

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:39.010
Road.

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:40.470
What?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.760
I don't know,man. Why don't we
just chill out,think about this?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.550
What's there to think about?

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.900
Just don't know if going to the
roadhouse is the smartest idea.

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:08.010
Dean,it's another
premonition. I know it.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:12.250
This is gonna happen,and ash can tell us where.
Plus it could have some connection with the demon.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.570
My visions always do. That's my point.

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:16.480
There's gonna be hunters
there. I don't know if --

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.390
If going in and announcing that
you're some supernatural freak

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:22.590
With a demonic connection
is the best thing,okay?

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.450
So I'm a freak now?

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.920
You've always been a freak.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.040
Damn, little lady,
that was my room money.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.560
Then I guess you're
taking a truck nap tonight.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.080
I'd have checked the high scores
before you put your money down.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:53.820
Went and got yourself hustled,ed.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.990
Just can't stay away,huh?

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.580
Yeah,looks like. How you doing,jo?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.680
Where's ash? In his back room.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.700
Great. And I'm fine.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.820
Sorry. He's -We're kind
of on a bit of a timetable.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:26.810
Ash?

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:30.220
The conditions that led to
the sharpsville tragedy...

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.390
Hey,ash?

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.120
Hey,dr. Badass?

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:43.450
Sam. Dean.

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.110
Sam and dean.

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:51.340
Hey,ash, um,we need your help.

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:54.660
Hell,then, guess I need my pants.

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:02.980
So,I got a match. It's the logo
for the blue ridge bus lines.

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:04.930
Guthrie,oklahoma.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:09.440
Okay. Do me a favor. Check guthrie for any
demonic signs or omens or anything like that.

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:12.170
You think the demon is there?

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.250
Yeah. Maybe.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:17.740
Why would you think that?
Just check it,all right?

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:24.280
No,sir,nothing. No demon.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:28.110
All right. Try something else for me.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:31.440
Search guthrie for a house
fire. It would be 1983.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:35.580
Fire's origin would be a baby's nursery,
night of the kid's 6-Month birthday.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:43.650
Okay,now, that is just weird,man.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:46.560
Why the hell would i
be looking for that?

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:51.070
'Cause there's a pbr in it for you.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:53.720
Give me 15 minutes.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:20.590
What?

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:23.130
R.E.O. Speedwagon? Damn right,R.E.O.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.360
Kevin cronin sings it from the heart.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:28.010
He sings it from the
hair. There's a difference.

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:34.600
That profile you've got ash looking for?

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.940
Your mom died the
same way, didn't she --

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:40.400
The fire in sam's nursery?

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:43.940
Look,jo,it's kind of a
family thing. I could help.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:47.500
I'm sure you could,but we got
to handle this one ourselves.

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:51.590
Besides,if I ran off with you,
think your mother might kill me.

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:56.440
You're afraid of my mother?

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:58.270
I think so.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.220
We have a match. We got to go.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:02.830
All right,jo, see you later.

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:12.670
And even as I wander
I'm keeping you in sight

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:19.420
You're a candle in the window
on a cold,dark winter's night

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:24.550
And I'm getting closer
than I ever thought

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:26.580
I mi-Ight

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:29.440
You're kidding,right?

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:33.770
I heard the song somewhere. I can't get it out
of my head. I don't know,man. What do you got?

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:38.480
Andrew gallagher.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:41.930
Born in '83,like me.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:44.890
Lost his mother in a nursery
fire exactly six months later,

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.060
Also like me.

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:47.750
You think the demon killed his mom?

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:48.650
Sure looks like it.

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:49.940
How did you know to look for this guy?

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:52.110
Every premonition I've had,
if they're not about the demon,

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:54.480
They're about the other
kids the demon visited.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:55.840
Like max miller. Remember him?

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:58.450
Yeah,but max miller was
a basic little psycho.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:01.790
Point is he was killing people,and I was
having the same type of visions about him.

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:04.450
And now it could be happening all
over again with this gallagher guy.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.980
How do we find him? I don't know.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.520
No current address,
no current employment.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:11.750
Still owes money on all his
bills -Phone,credit,utilities.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.730
Collection agency flags?

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.210
Not in the system.

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.910
They just let him take a walk?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.660
Seems like it.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:22.400
There's a work address from
his last w-2 about a year ago.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.450
Let's start there.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:34.840
You won't get anything out of
andy,guys. I'm sorry,but they never do.

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:36.500
"They"?

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:38.760
You're debt collectors, right?

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.760
Once in a while, they come by.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:44.260
I don't know what andy says to
them, but they never come back.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:48.750
Actually,we're lawyers
representing his great-Aunt lita.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:52.660
She passed -God rest her soul
-But left andy a sizable estate.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:55.680
Yeah. So,are you a friend of his?

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:59.150
I used to be,yeah. I don't
see much of andy anymore.

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:02.690
Andy? Andy kicks ass,man. Is that right?

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.600
Yeah. Andy can get you into anything.

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:07.530
He even got me backstage at
aerosmith once. It was beautiful,bro.

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:10.940
How about busing a table or two,webber?

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:14.270
Yeah,you bet,boss.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.880
Look,if you want to find
him, try orchard street.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:21.210
Just look for a van with the
barbarian queen painted on the side.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.730
Barbarian queen.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:25.880
She's riding a polar bear.
It's kind of hard to miss.

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:33.870
I'm sorry. I'm starting to like
this dude. That van is sweet.

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:40.860
What's wrong? Nothing.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:43.310
Sam,you look like you're
sucking on a lemon.

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:47.190
This andrew gallagher -He's the
second guy like this we've found,dean.

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:50.170
Demon came to them when they were
kids. Now they're killing people.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.630
We don't know what andrew
gallagher is. Could be innocent.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.160
My visions haven't been wrong yet.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:55.760
What's your point?

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:58.850
My point is I'm one
of them. No,you're not.

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:01.760
Dean,the demon said he had plans
for me and children like me.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.690
Yeah?

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:06.660
Maybe this is his plan. Maybe
we're all a bunch of psychic freaks.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:08.430
Maybe we're all
supposed to be --

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.390
Killers? Yeah.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:12.340
So the demon wants you out
there,killing with your minds?

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:15.310
Give me a break. You're
not a murderer,sam!

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:17.850
You don't have it in your bones.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.270
No?

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.760
Last I checked, I kill
all kinds of things.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:26.090
Those things were asking for it.

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:28.330
There's a difference.

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:43.080
Got him.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:13.190
That's him,that older
guy. He's the shooter.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:17.640
Well,you keep on him.
I'll stick with andy.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.520
Hey! Hey.

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:10.590
This is a cherry ride. Yeah. Thanks.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:14.840
Man,you know,'67 -Impala's
best year,if you ask me.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.630
This is a serious classic.

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:20.480
You know,I just rebuilt her,too.
Can't let a car like this one go.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.160
Damn straight.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:25.050
Hey. Could I have it? Sure,man.

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:28.350
Sweet.

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:32.980
Hop right in there.
There you go. Very nice.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:35.670
Take it easy. All right.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:51.230
Hello? Yeah.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:43.250
Hello? Yeah.

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:47.310
Dean, andy's got the impala!

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:50.970
I know! He just sort of asked
me for it, and I let him take it.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:51.760
You what?

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:55.400
He full-On obi-Wan'd me.
It's mind control,man.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:16.620
I kept him out of the gun store.

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:21.060
I thought he was okay.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.750
I thought he was past it. At least...

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.510
I should've stayed with him.

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:34.050
Andy! What's up,dog?

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:37.420
Andy.

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:40.390
What are you doing here?

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:44.040
D-Dr. Jennings.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.610
He's dead.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.910
Oh,no,I-I'm sorry.

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:52.280
I don't know. I-I...

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:58.140
I just -I was upset,
and I wanted to see you.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:02.670
Well,I'm glad you did. I,um...

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.700
I missed you.

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:15.500
Oh,you know what? Some guys were
here this morning,looking for you.

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:18.890
What guys?

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:25.110
Thank god!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.930
I'm sorry,baby. I'll
never leave you again.

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:35.810
At least he left the keys in it.

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:38.580
Yeah. Real samaritan,this guy.

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:42.570
It looks like he can't work his mojo just by
twitching his nose. He's got to use verbal commands.

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:46.330
The doctor had just gotten off his cellphone
when he stepped in front of that bus.

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:50.280
Andy must've called him or something.

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:53.640
I don't know. Maybe. Beg your pardon?

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:55.070
I just don't know if he's our guy,sam.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:58.670
You had O.J. Convicted before he got out of
his bronco,and you have doubts about this?

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:01.530
He doesn't seem like the
stone-Cold killer type. That's all.

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:03.040
And O.J. Was guilty.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.460
Either way,how are we
gonna track this guy down?

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.200
Not a problem.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:13.330
Not exactly an inconspicuous ride.

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:15.780
Let's have a look.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:24.140
Oh,come on.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:28.700
This is -This is magnificent.
That's what this is.

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:32.620
Not exactly a serial
killer's lair,though.

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:36.190
There's no clown paintings on the walls

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:38.770
Or scissors stuck in victims' photos.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:40.840
I like the tiger.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:43.690
Hegel? Kant?

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:46.650
Wittgenstein? That's some
pretty heavy reading,dean.

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:49.090
Yeah,and,uh...

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:51.940
Moby dick's bong.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.580
You know,one day I'd
love to just sit down

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:07.370
And eat something that I didn't
have to microwave at a minimart.

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:11.230
What I don't get is the motive.
The doctor was squeaky clean.

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.790
Why would andy waste him?

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.430
If it is andy.

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:16.480
Dude,enough. Why?

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:18.920
The doctor was mind-Controlled
in front of a bus.

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:22.300
Andy just happens to have the power
of mind control. You do the math.

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:23.990
I don't think the guy has it in him.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:25.260
How the hell would you know?

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:26.850
Why are you bending over
backwards defending him?

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:27.930
'Cause you're not right about this.

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:29.540
About andy?

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:32.030
Hey! You think I haven't seen you two?

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:34.550
Why are you following me?

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:36.850
Well,we're lawyers. A
relative of yours has --

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:39.880
Tell the truth!
That's what --

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:42.670
We hunt demons. What?

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:46.350
Demons and spirits. Things your
worst nightmares wouldn't even touch.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:48.120
Sam's my brother. Dean,shut up.

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:51.160
I'm trying. He's psychic,like
you. Well,not really like you.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:52.620
He thinks you're a murderer,

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:56.160
And he's afraid he's gonna become one himself
cause you're all part of something that's terrible.

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:59.790
I hope to hell that he's wrong, but I'm
starting to get scared he might be right.

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:03.070
Okay,you know what? Just leave me alone.

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:05.260
All right?

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:11.100
What are you doing?
Look,I-I said,leave me alone.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:14.110
Get out of here! Just start
driving and never stop!

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:16.120
Doesn't seem to work on me,andy.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:17.480
What?

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:20.080
You can make people
do things, can't you?

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.940
You can tell them what to think.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:23.950
That's crazy.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.170
All started a year ago, didn't it?

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:30.000
After you turned 22. Little stuff at first,
then you got better at controlling it.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.170
How do you know all this?

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:34.720
'Cause the same thing happened to
me,andy. My mom died in a fire,too.

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:37.300
I have abilities,too.

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:38.760
You see,we're connected, you and me.

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.840
Just -Just get out of here!

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:43.520
Why did you tell the doctor
to walk in front of a bus?

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:45.320
What?

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:55.040
Why did you kill him? I didn'T.

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:04.990
Hello?

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.580
Sure.

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:11.200
I can do that.

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:41.650
Hey!

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:44.370
Lady,what are you doing?!
It's gonna be okay.

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:47.260
Lady,no. No!

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:01.570
Sam? What is it?

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.530
I didn't do anything to him.

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:08.980
A woman. A woman burning alive.

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:09.710
What else you get?

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:12.070
A gas station. A woman
is gonna kill herself.

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:13.500
What does he mean, "going to"?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.230
Shut up.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.480
She gets triggered
by a call on her cell.

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:19.320
When? I don't know.

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:21.990
As long as we keep our eyes on this
son of a bitch,he can't hurt her.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:24.160
I didn't hurt anybody! Yeah,not yet.

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:32.170
Go.

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:34.290
No. Not you.

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:36.720
You're staying here with me.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:42.290
Hey,it's me. She's dead.
Burned up,just like you said.

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:44.180
When?

00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:46.780
Minutes before I got here.
The smell hasn't even cleared.

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:49.090
What's up with your visions?
This wasn't even a head start.

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:51.920
I can't control them. I don't
know what the hell is going on.

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:55.120
You were with andy when this whole
thing went down,so it can't be him.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.710
It's got to be somebody else.

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:57.750
That doesn't make any sense.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:00.810
What else is new? I'll dig around
here, see what else I can find.

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:10.600
You get these premonitions
of people about to die?

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:13.870
That's impossible.

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:18.280
A lot of people would say the
same thing about what you do.

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:21.890
Death visions? Yeah.

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:23.950
Dude,that sucks.

00:22:23.950 --> 00:22:27.590
When I got my mind
thing, it was like a gift.

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:29.030
It was like I won the lotto.

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:31.730
But you still live in a van.

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:35.500
I don't get it. You could
have anything you ever wanted.

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:40.400
Yeah,but I-I got everything I need.

00:22:43.700 --> 00:22:45.470
So you're really not a killer,huh?

00:22:45.470 --> 00:22:48.420
That's what I've been
trying to tell you.

00:22:49.690 --> 00:22:51.520
That's good.

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:53.810
That means there's hope for both of us.

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:03.950
Victim's name was holly
beckett. 41. Single.

00:23:03.950 --> 00:23:06.360
Who is she? Never heard of her.

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:09.050
I called ash on the way over. He
came up with a little something.

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:13.610
Apparently holly beckett gave birth
when she was 18 years old,back in 1983 --

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:15.980
Same day you were born,andy.

00:23:17.130 --> 00:23:19.520
Andy, were you adopted?

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:20.720
Well,yeah.

00:23:20.720 --> 00:23:23.930
You were? And you
neglected to mention that?

00:23:24.280 --> 00:23:28.370
It never really came up. I mean,I
never knew my birth parents,

00:23:28.370 --> 00:23:32.310
And,like you said, my adopted
mom died when I was a baby.

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.590
Do you think this holly
woman could actually be --

00:23:34.590 --> 00:23:38.750
I don't know. Tried to get a copy of the birth
records,but they're sealed in the county office.

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:42.040
Well,screw that.

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:45.990
Probably shouldn't have
let you kids in here.

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:48.230
No. It'll all be fine, all right?

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:50.920
Just go get a cup of coffee, all right?

00:23:51.310 --> 00:23:53.810
These aren't the droids
you're looking for.

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:56.220
Awesome.

00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:57.880
I got it. Yeah?

00:23:57.880 --> 00:24:01.150
Yeah.

00:24:01.150 --> 00:24:03.220
Andy,it's true.

00:24:03.600 --> 00:24:06.900
Holly beckett was your birth mother.

00:24:08.580 --> 00:24:09.850
Does anyone have a vicodin?

00:24:09.850 --> 00:24:11.890
Dr. Jennings was her doctor,too.

00:24:11.890 --> 00:24:15.020
I mean, he oversaw the adoption.

00:24:15.370 --> 00:24:17.090
You have a solid
connection to both of them.

00:24:17.090 --> 00:24:19.720
Yeah,but I didn't kill
them. We believe you.

00:24:21.200 --> 00:24:23.800
Yeah. But,uh,who did?

00:24:23.800 --> 00:24:26.250
I think I got a pretty good guess.

00:24:27.230 --> 00:24:30.020
Holly beckett gave birth to twins.

00:24:31.260 --> 00:24:34.180
I have an evil twin.

00:24:34.890 --> 00:24:37.770
Holly put you and your
brother up for adoption.

00:24:37.770 --> 00:24:41.410
And you went to the
gallagher family,obviously,

00:24:41.410 --> 00:24:45.410
And your brother went to the
weems family from upstate.

00:24:46.840 --> 00:24:48.910
Andy,how you doing? Still with us?

00:24:50.820 --> 00:24:52.110
Um...what was my brother's name?

00:24:52.110 --> 00:24:55.780
Here. Um,ansem weems?

00:24:56.950 --> 00:24:59.500
He's got a local address. He lives here?

00:24:59.500 --> 00:25:01.170
Let's get a look at him.

00:25:01.170 --> 00:25:03.930
Got his picture coming
over from the dmv right now.

00:25:13.640 --> 00:25:16.480
Hate to kick you while you're freaked.

00:25:17.920 --> 00:25:19.860
Take a look at that.

00:25:23.800 --> 00:25:25.950
Hey,trace? Yeah?

00:25:27.600 --> 00:25:31.060
You and andy,you guys went
together for a while,didn't you?

00:25:31.620 --> 00:25:33.250
Yeah,webber,why?

00:25:33.250 --> 00:25:37.610
I don't know. Just wondering. I was
wondering how you felt about him these days.

00:25:37.610 --> 00:25:41.170
I mean,I've seen you guys together. It
seems like there's still something there.

00:25:42.790 --> 00:25:45.740
Were you guys ever, like,serious?

00:25:46.130 --> 00:25:47.940
Um...no.

00:25:47.940 --> 00:25:50.670
Come on,trace. Tell the truth.

00:25:53.630 --> 00:25:56.550
All right,andy,tell us everything
you know about this guy.

00:25:58.120 --> 00:26:03.360
I don't know much. Webber shows
up one day like eight months ago,

00:26:03.360 --> 00:26:05.510
Acting like he's my
best friend in the world.

00:26:05.510 --> 00:26:08.070
He's kind of weird,like
trying too hard,you know?

00:26:08.070 --> 00:26:09.790
He must've known you guys are twins.

00:26:09.790 --> 00:26:12.290
Why did he change his name?
Why not tell you the truth?

00:26:14.740 --> 00:26:16.300
Sam?

00:27:05.860 --> 00:27:07.210
Sam? Oh,god!

00:27:07.210 --> 00:27:09.130
Sam?!

00:27:09.520 --> 00:27:10.730
Sam!

00:27:13.720 --> 00:27:15.630
Hey. Hey!

00:27:28.040 --> 00:27:29.940
I take my ladies here.

00:27:31.800 --> 00:27:33.840
They like it.

00:27:34.750 --> 00:27:38.590
Well,I mean,I like it,
so,of course,they do,too.

00:27:42.220 --> 00:27:45.600
Please. I just want to go home.

00:27:45.600 --> 00:27:48.260
Stop crying.

00:27:50.100 --> 00:27:52.120
Hey.

00:27:54.230 --> 00:27:57.110
I get it. I see what you see in andy.

00:27:57.110 --> 00:28:00.400
I mean,he's a genius.
The books he reads --

00:28:00.400 --> 00:28:03.280
He's gonna be a great man someday.

00:28:06.210 --> 00:28:09.940
But he is my family, not yours.

00:28:10.680 --> 00:28:13.230
You can't have him.

00:28:13.230 --> 00:28:16.460
You're not gonna have
anything after tonight.

00:28:32.260 --> 00:28:33.530
Dean, you should stay back.

00:28:33.530 --> 00:28:36.660
No argument here. I had my head
screwed with enough for one day.

00:28:41.620 --> 00:28:44.910
I'm coming with
you. Andy --

00:28:44.910 --> 00:28:48.630
That's tracy out there, and I'm coming.

00:28:52.040 --> 00:28:55.270
Okay. Ch-Ch--
Slower.

00:28:59.930 --> 00:29:01.940
Tracy...

00:29:02.960 --> 00:29:06.260
I want you to listen to
me very carefully,okay?

00:29:08.110 --> 00:29:10.740
When we're done here

00:29:12.150 --> 00:29:17.320
I want you to head over to
the edge of that dam,okay?

00:29:19.410 --> 00:29:21.060
Okay.

00:29:22.680 --> 00:29:24.920
And when you get there

00:29:26.090 --> 00:29:28.560
You're gonna think you can fly.

00:29:30.790 --> 00:29:33.880
And you're just gonna step right off.

00:29:36.540 --> 00:29:39.140
You -You can fly,can't you?

00:29:41.650 --> 00:29:44.760
Yeah. I think so.

00:29:44.760 --> 00:29:46.500
You might get scared,

00:29:46.500 --> 00:29:50.370
But I want you to say that it's okay.

00:29:52.490 --> 00:29:57.940
Just tell yourself,
"everything is okay."

00:29:59.510 --> 00:30:01.720
Get out of the car! Now!

00:30:01.720 --> 00:30:04.080
You really don't want to do this.

00:30:05.950 --> 00:30:07.750
Trace,give me your hand.
Come here,come here.

00:30:07.750 --> 00:30:11.870
I couldn't control myself.

00:30:11.870 --> 00:30:14.830
Hey! Don't move. Don't move!

00:30:16.770 --> 00:30:18.420
No! No! I will kill you!

00:30:18.420 --> 00:30:19.940
Andy! Hey,hey,hey! No!
No! I'll handle this!

00:30:20.010 --> 00:30:23.260
I will kill you!

00:30:23.260 --> 00:30:26.110
Andy,listen to me! Just listen to me!

00:30:28.100 --> 00:30:31.780
Tracy,stop! I said,stop it!

00:30:43.200 --> 00:30:45.840
How did you do that? Practice,bro.

00:30:46.610 --> 00:30:49.160
If you just practiced, you would know.

00:30:49.160 --> 00:30:52.320
Sometimes... you don't
need to use your words.

00:30:52.320 --> 00:30:55.970
If you have to, all you need is this.

00:30:56.450 --> 00:30:57.990
Sometimes the headache is worth it.

00:30:57.990 --> 00:30:59.470
You twisted son of a bitch!

00:30:59.470 --> 00:31:02.690
Back off,andy! Or tracy is
gonna do a little flying.

00:31:10.260 --> 00:31:12.570
Aren't you,trace?

00:31:14.260 --> 00:31:17.440
I'm stronger than you. I can do it.

00:31:20.480 --> 00:31:23.140
Okay,okay. Okay.

00:31:23.140 --> 00:31:26.340
All right,just... please don't hurt her.

00:31:26.340 --> 00:31:29.550
Don't be mad at me,okay?
I know. It's all wrong.

00:31:29.550 --> 00:31:32.110
I didn't mean for this
to happen. It's just...

00:31:33.030 --> 00:31:35.240
Tracy
--

00:31:35.670 --> 00:31:38.030
She's trying to come between us.

00:31:38.030 --> 00:31:39.880
You're insane. She's garbage!

00:31:39.880 --> 00:31:41.640
Man,they all are!

00:31:41.640 --> 00:31:44.380
We can push them. We can
make them do whatever we want!

00:31:46.160 --> 00:31:49.240
Are you really -Are you
really this stupid? Is it --

00:31:50.220 --> 00:31:53.020
You learn you got a twin,

00:31:53.020 --> 00:31:55.540
You call him up, you go out for a drink.

00:31:55.540 --> 00:31:57.700
You don't start killing people!

00:31:57.700 --> 00:32:01.610
I wanted to tell you
for so long,bro,but...

00:32:03.030 --> 00:32:05.770
He didn't let me. He said I
had to wait until the time --

00:32:05.770 --> 00:32:08.190
Who? The man with the yellow eyes.

00:32:11.550 --> 00:32:12.700
What are you talking about?

00:32:12.700 --> 00:32:16.300
He came to me... in my dream.

00:32:17.770 --> 00:32:20.200
He said I was special.

00:32:20.670 --> 00:32:23.950
He told me he's got big plans for me.

00:32:23.950 --> 00:32:26.830
Wait till you see what's in
store,andy,for both of us.

00:32:28.260 --> 00:32:33.870
See,he's the one who told me
that I had a brother,a twin.

00:32:40.640 --> 00:32:42.720
Why did you kill our mother?

00:32:42.720 --> 00:32:44.410
And why dr. Jennings?

00:32:44.410 --> 00:32:47.120
Because they split us up!

00:32:47.760 --> 00:32:50.290
They ruined our lives, andy!

00:32:50.290 --> 00:32:53.430
We could've been
together this whole time

00:32:53.430 --> 00:32:56.040
Instead of alone.

00:32:56.730 --> 00:32:59.920
I couldn't let them do that. I
couldn't let them get away with that.

00:33:01.120 --> 00:33:02.920
No.

00:33:13.830 --> 00:33:16.490
I see you.

00:33:17.440 --> 00:33:19.740
Bye-Bye.

00:33:54.680 --> 00:33:56.980
He shot himself.

00:33:57.410 --> 00:33:59.920
And you all saw it happen.

00:34:01.280 --> 00:34:04.020
Yeah. We did.

00:34:04.820 --> 00:34:07.400
Look at him. He's getting better at it.

00:34:25.460 --> 00:34:27.400
She won't even look at me.

00:34:28.070 --> 00:34:30.350
Yeah, she's pretty shaken up.

00:34:30.350 --> 00:34:33.500
No,it's -This is different.

00:34:33.500 --> 00:34:35.630
This
is --

00:34:35.630 --> 00:34:40.070
I never used my mind thing on
her before,before last night.

00:34:42.540 --> 00:34:45.040
She's scared of me now.

00:34:49.650 --> 00:34:52.380
Andy,I hate to do this, but,um...

00:34:53.950 --> 00:34:56.600
We have to get out of here. Here.

00:34:57.070 --> 00:34:59.160
I wrote down my cell.

00:35:00.010 --> 00:35:05.810
You don't have to be alone in this,all right?
If anything comes up,you can call me up.

00:35:10.040 --> 00:35:15.340
Wh-What am I supposed to do now?

00:35:15.340 --> 00:35:17.690
You be good,andy...

00:35:18.100 --> 00:35:20.040
Or we'll be back.

00:35:28.010 --> 00:35:29.620
Looks like I was right.

00:35:29.620 --> 00:35:31.480
About what? Andy.

00:35:32.030 --> 00:35:34.450
He's a killer after all.

00:35:35.040 --> 00:35:38.010
No,he's a hero. He saved his
girlfriend's life. He saved my life.

00:35:38.010 --> 00:35:41.440
Bottom line, last night
he wasted somebody.

00:35:41.440 --> 00:35:44.110
Yeah,but he's not a
foaming-At-The-Mouth psycho.

00:35:44.110 --> 00:35:47.060
He was just -He was pushed into that.

00:35:47.060 --> 00:35:49.300
Webber was pushed,too, in his own way.

00:35:49.300 --> 00:35:52.040
Max miller was pushed. Hell,I
was pushed by jessica's death.

00:35:52.040 --> 00:35:53.070
What's your point,sam?

00:35:53.070 --> 00:35:55.810
Right circumstances, everyone
is capable of murder -Everyone.

00:35:56.900 --> 00:36:00.240
Maybe that's what the demon is doing
-Pushing us,finding ways to break us.

00:36:00.240 --> 00:36:02.930
We don't know what the demon wants,okay?

00:36:02.930 --> 00:36:05.030
Quit worrying about it.

00:36:06.030 --> 00:36:08.950
You know,I heard you before,dean,
when andy made you tell the truth.

00:36:09.480 --> 00:36:11.280
You're just as scared of this as I am.

00:36:11.280 --> 00:36:15.140
That was mind control! It's like
being roofied man. That doesn't count.

00:36:15.140 --> 00:36:17.890
No,I-I'm calling
do-Over. What are you,7?

00:36:17.890 --> 00:36:20.310
Doesn't matter. We just got
to keep doing what we're doing,

00:36:20.310 --> 00:36:22.500
Find that evil son of
a bitch, and kill it.

00:36:25.480 --> 00:36:27.460
Yeah. I guess.

00:36:29.970 --> 00:36:31.670
Hello?

00:36:32.530 --> 00:36:35.190
Ellen. What's going on?

00:36:37.300 --> 00:36:39.640
Yeah. We'll be right there.

00:36:46.530 --> 00:36:48.400
Jo?

00:36:48.400 --> 00:36:50.180
Go pull up another case of beer.

00:36:50.180 --> 00:36:52.420
Mom --
Now. Please?

00:36:55.910 --> 00:36:59.860
So,you,uh,you want to tell me
about this last hunt of yours?

00:37:00.920 --> 00:37:02.670
Nope. Not really.

00:37:04.740 --> 00:37:08.060
No offense. Just kind of a family thing.

00:37:08.650 --> 00:37:10.450
Not anymore.

00:37:11.350 --> 00:37:13.500
I got this stuff from ash.

00:37:15.580 --> 00:37:19.430
Andrew gallagher's house burned down on
his 6-Month birthday,just like your house.

00:37:20.140 --> 00:37:23.760
You think it was the demon both times,don't
you? You think it went after gallagher's family?

00:37:24.430 --> 00:37:25.850
Yeah,we think so. Sam.

00:37:25.850 --> 00:37:28.030
Why? None of your business.

00:37:28.370 --> 00:37:30.020
You mind your tongue with me,boy.

00:37:30.020 --> 00:37:32.050
This isn't just your war. This is war.

00:37:32.050 --> 00:37:35.550
Something big and bad is coming,and it's
coming fast,and their side holds all the cards.

00:37:35.550 --> 00:37:39.140
Now,at best,all we got is us -Together.

00:37:40.570 --> 00:37:42.970
No secrets or half-Truths here.

00:37:47.130 --> 00:37:49.310
There are people out there

00:37:49.310 --> 00:37:51.800
Like andy gallagher...

00:37:53.340 --> 00:37:55.780
Like me...

00:37:56.180 --> 00:37:58.570
And,um...

00:37:59.120 --> 00:38:01.330
We all have some kind of ability.

00:38:01.330 --> 00:38:02.970
Ability? Yeah.

00:38:02.970 --> 00:38:05.240
A psychic ability.

00:38:05.770 --> 00:38:08.310
Me,I have,um...

00:38:09.510 --> 00:38:11.820
I have visions...

00:38:12.250 --> 00:38:16.350
Premonitions. I don't know.
It's different for everybody.

00:38:18.920 --> 00:38:22.460
The demon said he had
plans for people like us.

00:38:22.460 --> 00:38:23.920
What kind of plans?

00:38:23.920 --> 00:38:25.140
We don't really know for sure.

00:38:25.140 --> 00:38:27.880
These people out there, these
psychics,are they dangerous?

00:38:27.880 --> 00:38:29.760
No.

00:38:29.760 --> 00:38:31.140
Not all of them.

00:38:31.140 --> 00:38:32.280
But some are. Some are very dangerous.

00:38:32.280 --> 00:38:33.630
How many?

00:38:33.630 --> 00:38:36.100
We've been able to track
a clear pattern so far.

00:38:36.100 --> 00:38:38.900
They've all had house fires on the
night of the kid's 6-Month birthday.

00:38:38.900 --> 00:38:41.000
That's not true.

00:38:41.740 --> 00:38:43.010
What?

00:38:43.010 --> 00:38:48.290
Webber or ansem weems or
whatever his name is --

00:38:49.660 --> 00:38:53.050
I looked at his files, and
there was no house fire.

00:38:53.440 --> 00:38:55.930
There's nothing out of the ordinary.

00:38:56.710 --> 00:39:00.110
Which breaks pattern. So if
there's any others like him,

00:39:00.110 --> 00:39:01.950
There would be nothing in the system,

00:39:01.950 --> 00:39:04.090
No way to track them all down.

00:39:05.340 --> 00:39:08.540
And so who knows how many
of them are really out there?

